Client comment on BUG-195 - Tester B, 11/06/2026, 12:41:38 PM
@Coordinator - the expected behaviour is that if the reviewer raises a query, the submitter should be able to amend the attachments on the entry: upload a replacement video and add further documents. In the scenario Tester C highlighted, the submitter cannot change the video and cannot add documents. They should be able to.

ref 5003

Client comment on BUG-195 - Tester C, 11/06/2026, 12:04:15 PM
@Coordinator I believe this is not the expected behaviour. When a query is sent back, there should be an option to upload the required video. In this scenario the submitter gets no upload option at all.

ref 5004
